    "## Validation MAP@3 Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "Although the BiLSTM model is trained using Binary Cross-Entropy Loss, the competition evaluates predictions using Mean Average Precision at 3 (MAP@3).\n",
    "\n",
    "To estimate competition performance, the model is evaluated on the validation set by:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Predicting probabilities for all five answer options.\n",
    "2. Ranking the options according to predicted probability.\n",
    "3. Comparing the top three predictions with the correct answer.\n",
    "4. Computing the Mean Average Precision at 3 (MAP@3).\n",
    "\n",
    "This provides a better estimate of competition performance than accuracy alone."
