    "The three models disagreed on **77 validation questions**, showing that their prediction behaviour was not identical even when evaluated on the same questions.\n",
    "\n",
    "The disagreement analysis also shows that retrieved context and semantic reranking do not always lead to the correct answer. RAG made substantially more Top-1 errors than the supervised BiLSTM and DistilBERT models on this validation split.\n",
